<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Furniture Discounters — Local Catalog</title><link rel="icon" href="__LOGO__"><style>__CSS__</style></head><body data-page="editor"><header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner"><span class="brand"><img class="brand-logo" src="__LOGO__" alt=""><span class="brand-name">Furniture<span>Discounters</span></span></span><span>Local catalog &amp; orders</span></div></header><main class="container dashboard" id="main"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Your store, on your computer</p><h1>Room to <em>create.</em></h1><p>Organize furniture, update prices, and find your saved orders. No account or sign-in.</p></section>
<section class="editor-firebase-panel"><h2>Firebase database</h2><p>Publish products, categories, settings and photos without changing private orders. Use full publication only when you also intend to publish local order records. Customers can browse products; only your store account can change the database or read private orders.</p><form id="firebase-login" class="form-grid"><label>Store email<input name="email" type="email" value="furniture.discounters.offcial@gmail.com" autocomplete="username" required></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button class="button button-secondary">Connect Firebase</button><button id="firebase-create-account" class="text-button" type="button">Create store account</button></form><div class="editor-toolbar"><button id="firebase-load" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Load from Firebase</button><button id="firebase-publish-products" class="button button-primary" type="button">Publish products only</button><button id="firebase-publish" class="button button-primary" type="button">Publish catalog and orders</button><button id="firebase-verify" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Send verification email</button><button id="firebase-logout" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Disconnect</button></div><p class="small">If online order deletion is blocked, update the Firebase rules once: <button id="copy-firebase-rules" type="button" class="text-button">Copy rules</button> · <a href="https://console.firebase.google.com/project/furniture-discounters/firestore/databases/-default-/rules" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Firebase rules</a>. Paste the copied rules and click Publish.</p><p id="firebase-status" role="status">Local editing is available. Connect to load or publish your Firebase database.</p></section><div class="editor-toolbar"><button id="open-database" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Open database</button><button id="save-database" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Save database</button><button id="backup-database" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Backup with photos</button><button id="export-website" class="button button-primary" type="button">Export website catalog</button><input id="database-file" type="file" accept=".json,.zip" hidden></div><div id="storage-warning" class="editor-storage-warning" role="alert" hidden><strong>This preview cannot keep your database after refresh.</strong><p>Use Backup with photos before closing or refreshing, then Open database to restore that ZIP. Download and open the editor on your computer for normal local storage.</p></div><p class="editor-publication-note">Click Publish products only to update the online catalog. Local edits and downloaded backups stay separate until published. Export website catalog is available for a static backup.</p><p id="save-status" role="status">Creating your local database…</p><p id="editor-feedback" class="form-feedback" role="alert"></p>
<nav class="dashboard-tabs" aria-label="Sections"><button data-tab="catalog" class="button button-secondary" aria-current="true" type="button">Categories &amp; products</button><button data-tab="orders" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Orders &amp; numbers</button><button data-tab="settings" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Store information</button></nav>
<section id="tab-catalog"><div class="editor-layout"><aside class="admin-panel category-sidebar"><h2>Categories</h2><button id="new-category" class="text-button" type="button">+ Add category</button><div id="category-list" class="collection-strip" tabindex="0" aria-label="Categories"></div></aside><section class="admin-panel editor-catalog"><div class="editor-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your collection</p><h2 id="selected-category">All furniture</h2></div><div><button id="edit-category" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Edit category style</button><button id="new-subcategory" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>+ Add subcategory</button><button id="new-product" class="button button-primary" type="button">Add product here</button></div></div><div id="subcategory-list" class="category-chips collection-strip" tabindex="0" aria-label="Subcategories"></div><div id="subcategory-actions" hidden><button id="edit-subcategory" class="text-button" type="button">Edit subcategory</button></div><label for="editor-search">Search products</label><input id="editor-search" type="search" maxlength="200" placeholder="Name, SKU or material"><p id="product-count" role="status"></p><div id="editor-products" class="product-grid"></div><div class="catalog-pagination"><button id="editor-previous" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Previous</button><span id="editor-page"></span><button id="editor-next" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Next</button></div></section></div>
<section id="category-editor" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Category &amp; appearance</h2><form id="category-form" class="stack-form"><input name="id" type="hidden"><label>Name<input name="name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Category color<input name="accent" type="color" value="#7e6049"></label><label>Desktop columns<select name="columns"><option value="2">2 — larger photographs</option><option value="3" selected>3 — balanced</option><option value="4">4 — compact</option></select></label><label>Display order<input name="sortOrder" type="number" min="0" max="10000" step="1" required></label></div><label>Category photograph path<input name="imagePath" placeholder="assets/products/room.webp"></label><label>Add category photograph<input id="category-photo-upload" type="file" accept="image/*,.jpg,.jpeg,.jfif,.png,.webp,.gif,.bmp,.avif,.heic,.heif"></label><p id="category-photo-status" class="small" role="status">Choose a photo to see its preview.</p><div id="category-photo-preview" class="photo-editor"></div><button id="remove-category-photo" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Remove photo</button><label class="check-label"><input name="active" type="checkbox" checked> Show on website</label><button class="button button-primary">Save category</button><button id="cancel-category" class="text-button" type="button">Close</button><button id="delete-category" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Delete empty category</button></form></section>
<section id="subcategory-editor" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Subcategory</h2><form id="subcategory-form" class="stack-form"><input name="id" type="hidden"><label>Parent category<select name="category" required></select></label><label>Name<input name="name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label>Subcategory photograph path<input name="imagePath" placeholder="assets/products/room.webp"></label><label>Add subcategory photograph<input id="subcategory-photo-upload" type="file" accept="image/*,.jpg,.jpeg,.jfif,.png,.webp,.gif,.bmp,.avif,.heic,.heif"></label><p id="subcategory-photo-status" class="small" role="status">Choose a photo to see its preview.</p><div id="subcategory-photo-preview" class="photo-editor"></div><button id="remove-subcategory-photo" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Remove photo</button><label class="check-label"><input name="active" type="checkbox" checked> Show on website</label><button class="button button-primary">Save subcategory</button><button id="cancel-subcategory" class="text-button" type="button">Close</button><button id="delete-subcategory" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Delete empty subcategory</button></form></section>
<section id="product-editor" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Furniture details</h2><form id="product-form" class="stack-form"><input name="id" type="hidden"><label>Name<input name="name" maxlength="160" required></label><label>SKU<input name="sku" maxlength="80" required></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="5000"></textarea></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Current price (USD)<input name="price" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01" required></label><label>Previous price (optional)<input name="oldPrice" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01"></label><label>Stock<input name="stock" type="number" min="0" max="100000" step="1" required></label></div><p class="small">Changing a saved price fills the previous price automatically. Clear it to stop showing a crossed-out price.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Category<select name="category" required></select></label><label>Subcategory<select name="subcategory"></select></label></div><label>Dimensions<input name="dimensions" maxlength="250" placeholder="Width × depth × height"></label><label>Material<input name="material" maxlength="250" placeholder="Solid oak, fabric, leather…"></label><label>Finish<input name="finish" maxlength="250"></label><label>Choose photographs<input id="product-photo-upload" type="file" accept="image/*,.jpg,.jpeg,.jfif,.png,.webp,.gif,.bmp,.avif,.heic,.heif" multiple></label><p id="product-photo-status" class="small" role="status">Choose a photo to see its preview.</p><p class="small">Photos are resized for the website and saved locally. Use up to eight per product.</p><label>Photograph paths (one per line)<textarea name="imagePaths" id="product-image-paths" rows="3" required placeholder="Choose photos above, or enter existing assets/products paths"></textarea></label><div id="photo-preview" class="photo-editor"></div><label class="check-label"><input name="active" type="checkbox" checked> Show on website</label><label class="check-label"><input name="available" type="checkbox" checked> Available for pickup</label><label class="check-label"><input name="featured" type="checkbox"> Feature on home page</label><button class="button button-primary">Save product</button><button id="cancel-product" class="text-button" type="button">Close</button><button id="delete-product" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Delete product</button></form></section></section>
<section id="tab-orders" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Orders &amp; numbers</h2><p>Website orders appear live when you connect your verified store account. Local records are included here too. Viewing orders does not replace your catalog.</p><p id="live-orders-status" role="status">Connect Firebase to see incoming orders live.</p><p id="order-count" role="status"></p><form id="order-search-form" class="lookup-input-row"><label class="sr-only" for="order-number-search">Order number</label><input id="order-number-search" maxlength="80" placeholder="Enter an exact order or inquiry number"><button class="button button-primary">Find order</button></form><button id="new-order" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Record an order</button><button id="show-orders" class="text-button" type="button">Show all orders</button><p class="small">Check off an order to permanently delete it and its online record. This cannot be undone.</p><div id="order-results"></div><section id="order-editor" hidden><h3>Order record</h3><form id="order-form" class="stack-form"><input name="id" type="hidden"><input name="week" type="hidden"><input name="lookupKey" type="hidden"><label>Order / inquiry number<input name="number" maxlength="80" required></label><label>Add furniture<select id="order-add-product"></select></label><button id="add-order-line" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Add furniture</button><div id="order-lines"></div><p id="order-total"></p><label>Notes<textarea name="notes" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><p class="small">Order items keep the price recorded here. Update catalog stock yourself after a confirmed sale.</p><button class="button button-primary">Save order</button><button id="cancel-order" class="text-button" type="button">Close</button></form></section></section>
<section id="tab-settings" class="admin-panel" hidden><h2>Store information</h2><form id="settings-form" class="stack-form"><label>Announcement<input name="announcement" maxlength="300"></label><label>Store address<textarea name="address" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><label>Hours<textarea name="hours" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><label>Phone<input name="phone" maxlength="40"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="254"></label><label>Pickup instructions<textarea name="pickupInstructions" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>Store story<textarea name="story" maxlength="5000"></textarea></label><button class="button button-primary">Save store information</button></form></section>
<p class="small editor-help">Changes save in this browser automatically. Save a database backup to keep a portable copy. Export the website catalog and upload its assets folder to GitHub to update the public website.</p></main><script>__JS__</script></body></html>
